# Generation pod environment, pre-declared fallback pin set "fallback-tf-bnb" (decision 24/09): both fallbacks,
# transformers 5.15.0 with tokenizers 0.22.2 and bitsandbytes 0.49.2, only when neither alone works.
# Chosen ONLY at the canary (KIND=gen GEN_SET=fallback-tf-bnb bash ops/pod_bootstrap.sh), then fixed for the whole
# run: every job names it (--pin-set fallback-tf-bnb). Resolves for x86_64-manylinux_2_28, Python 3.12 (uv pip
# compile). These pins equal v2gpu.engines.PIN_SETS["fallback-tf-bnb"] (tested).
